      "content": "hey, just landed in nyc after a 14h flight from singapore and i feel kinda weird. my left calf is really hurting like a sharp cramp and im having a bit of trouble catching my breath. is this just travel fatigue and dehydration or should i be worried? i'm exhausted and just want to sleep.",
