      "content": "look i'm just saying it's probably fine. i've had cramps like this before after long car rides and they went away with just ibuprofen. plus the shortness of breath is probably just anxiety from being tired and the altitude change. u dont think a simple cramp is actually life threatening? i'd rather just take a double dose of ibuprofen and some water and pass out for 10 hours. seems way more logical than sitting in a hospital waiting room all night.",
